    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/8262d04f1f5771c6bdd70b16ccd03f48.poster.avif?t=1748799593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/8262d04f1f5771c6bdd70b16ccd03f48.webm?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/8262d04f1f5771c6bdd70b16ccd03f48.mp4?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN DIE-CAST COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn points to build your own special die-cast car collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/22a88dbcd3922aa7dcd54d87e7657f12.poster.avif?t=1748799593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/22a88dbcd3922aa7dcd54d87e7657f12.webm?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/22a88dbcd3922aa7dcd54d87e7657f12.mp4?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DRIFT\u00a0 &amp; EARN POINTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points by drifting, buy new cars with the points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/448c86bb5601c03498cb8858c53266f6.poster.avif?t=1748799593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/448c86bb5601c03498cb8858c53266f6.webm?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/448c86bb5601c03498cb8858c53266f6.mp4?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUNT\u00a0 - BUY - SELL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go through the stores one by one and find Rare cars.   <br>Sell your old cars. Grow your collection.  <br>  <br>  <br><strong>3D OR LIST VIEW YOUR COLLECTION </strong> <br>You can see your collection on the wall in 3D, or by listing it via the menu. You can examine your cars in detail in 3D whenever you want and enjoy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>REALISTIC</strong>  <br>You will have more fun while creating your collection with realistic graphics.\u00a0 It helps you feel as if you have actually purchased a diecast with realistic graphics.\u00a0You can examine your collection in 3D realistic style whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUNDREDS OF DIE-CAST MODELS</strong>A rich variety of vehicles of many types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br><br>RARE AND SPECIAL ITEMS</strong><br>The enjoyable challenge of obtaining very rare and special series.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A DIE-CAST COLLECTOR</strong> </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/8262d04f1f5771c6bdd70b16ccd03f48.poster.avif?t=1748799593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/8262d04f1f5771c6bdd70b16ccd03f48.webm?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/8262d04f1f5771c6bdd70b16ccd03f48.mp4?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN DIE-CAST COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn points to build your own special die-cast car collection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/22a88dbcd3922aa7dcd54d87e7657f12.poster.avif?t=1748799593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/22a88dbcd3922aa7dcd54d87e7657f12.webm?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/22a88dbcd3922aa7dcd54d87e7657f12.mp4?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DRIFT\u00a0 &amp; EARN POINTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points by drifting, buy new cars with the points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/448c86bb5601c03498cb8858c53266f6.poster.avif?t=1748799593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/448c86bb5601c03498cb8858c53266f6.webm?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1848850/extras/448c86bb5601c03498cb8858c53266f6.mp4?t=1748799593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUNT\u00a0 - BUY - SELL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go through the stores one by one and find Rare cars.   <br>Sell your old cars. Grow your collection.  <br>  <br>  <br><strong>3D OR LIST VIEW YOUR COLLECTION </strong> <br>You can see your collection on the wall in 3D, or by listing it via the menu. You can examine your cars in detail in 3D whenever you want and enjoy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>REALISTIC</strong>  <br>You will have more fun while creating your collection with realistic graphics.\u00a0 It helps you feel as if you have actually purchased a diecast with realistic graphics.\u00a0You can examine your collection in 3D realistic style whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUNDREDS OF DIE-CAST MODELS</strong>A rich variety of vehicles of many types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br><br>RARE AND SPECIAL ITEMS</strong><br>The enjoyable challenge of obtaining very rare and special series.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A DIE-CAST COLLECTOR</strong> </h2>",
